OL,5,G2015 The Box
OL,6,     FGary Lineker hosts as the
OL,7,     Fcelebrities are pushed to the
OL,8,     Flimits of both mind and body as
OL,9,     Fthey face two very different
OL,10,     Fchallenges. First, they step into
OL,11,     Fa setting defined by power,
OL,12,     Fpressure and persuasion, where
OL,13,     Freputation counts for nothing.
OL,14,     FStripped of their public personas,
OL,15,     Fthey must rely on quick thinking
OL,16,     Fto come out on top. Next, the team
OL,17,     Fchallenge delivers a brutal test
OL,18,     Fof nerve as one group is
OL,19,     Fconfronted by a terrifying
OL,20,     Fvertical descent, while the other
OL,21,     Fbattles the unpredictability of
OL,22,     Fthe open sea
